From ca1203959cf9cccee229d8f0121650a19bf6aac4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Jelen <jjelen@redhat.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 10:38:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Update the upstream signing key

Update talloc.keyring to the current copy at
https://download.samba.org/pub/samba/samba-pubkey.asc#/talloc.keyring,
the URL the spec names for it (same certificate(s)).

The current key is needed to verify the release signature with
openpgpverify (sqv), which checks that the key was valid when the
release was signed.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
